# Multi-agent file ownership

Multiple agents must **never replace** each other's files. Extends the one-owner idea in `admin-ownership.mdc` (admin team/usage/invite). Do not vendor or delete other rules.

## Wait, then merge

Before editing a file another agent may be writing: **WAIT** until that agent finishes, re-read the file, then apply only your delta. If two tasks touch the same file, serialize. Never wholesale-rewrite a shared file to "fix conflicts."

```text
# ❌ BAD — clobber a file another agent just wrote
rewrite SharedFile.tsx from scratch to resolve a merge

# ✅ GOOD — wait, re-read, apply only your delta
# 1. Wait until the other agent finishes
# 2. Re-read SharedFile.tsx
# 3. Patch only the lines your task needs
```

## One owner per overlapping area

Prefer **one owner** per change set. Do not split the same file across parallel agents.

- **Studio/admin chrome:** `components/app/studio/*`, dashboard and admin pages. Shared chrome (`StudioShell`, `AppHeader`, `PageTabs`) is the studio owner's file; other screens import it.
- **App sidebar / workspace:** `components/layout/Sidebar`, `components/workspace/*`.
- **Auth/home:** login, `AuthModal`, public home, register.
- **Email:** `lib/email/client.ts`, `lib/email/templates/`. Provider-agnostic `sendEmail`; Resend or console dev driver. Do not log raw reset tokens except as part of the full dev-driver email.
- **Password reset:** `lib/password-reset/`, Prisma `PasswordResetToken`, `/api/auth/forgot-password`, `/api/auth/reset-password`, `/reset-password`, ADMIN `/api/admin/team/[id]/reset-link`. Merge only the forgot-link delta into `AuthModal` / `TeamTable`. Never store or display the raw token.
- **Projects backend:** Prisma `Project`, `lib/projects`, `/api/projects`.
- **Plan/Build + stacks:** `lib/projects/plan`, `/api/projects/[id]/plan`, `lib/stacks`.
- **Visual Edits:** `lib/visual-edits`, workspace preview toolbar. Merge inspector inject into static preview HTML at upload time only — do not write it into user source.
- **Preview builds:** `lib/preview/`, Prisma `PreviewBuild`, `/preview-static/{projectId}`, `/api/projects/[id]/preview`. Build inside the current generation sandbox then call `killSandbox`. Never boot a sandbox solely to build a preview. Do not rewrite sandbox create or publish. Merge retention into thin-checkpoints. Preview mode ≠ Coolify deploy mode.
- **Checkpoints:** `lib/checkpoints`, `/api/projects/[id]/checkpoints`, thin/purge crons. Object snapshots via `readSnapshot`/`writeSnapshot`. `readSnapshot` throws `SnapshotReadError` when storage fails — empty means empty; do not catch and fall through to `lastCode`. Merge into sandbox restore; do not rewrite `ensureSandbox`. After restore, merge a preview rebuild only.
- **Dev server / Prisma engine lock:** `prisma generate`, the live Prisma query engine (`generated/prisma/query_engine-windows.dll.node`), and any install that overwrites `node_modules/next` belong to the dedicated **dev server** agent — not sandbox, publish, or plans owners. After a migration, other agents MAY `prisma migrate deploy` if safe, then ask that agent to generate and restart (`single-dev-server.mdc`).
- **Sandbox lifecycle:** `lib/sandbox/manager.ts`, `lib/sandbox/teardown.ts`, `lib/sandbox/reap.ts`, `lib/sandbox/boot-errors.ts`, `/api/projects/[id]/sandbox`, `/api/cron/reap-sandboxes`. All VM create goes through `ensureSandbox` → `selectProvider` → the chosen driver (`e2b` | `modal` | `daytona`). Do not call E2B `Sandbox.create` outside `lib/sandbox/`. Merge idle/minutes metering and typed teardown only — do not rewrite `ensureSandbox`. A message must not say the VM "was stopped so it is not billed" unless teardown returned `stopped` or `already_gone`.
- **Sandbox providers:** `lib/sandbox/router.ts`, `lib/sandbox/provider.ts`, Prisma `SandboxProviderConfig`, ADMIN `/admin/sandbox-providers`, `POST /api/cron/check-sandbox-providers`. Sticky config id on Project/Job. `unknown` stays eligible; merge `selectionReason` / Next pick only. Do not add a fourth driver. Client chrome imports `lib/sandbox/provider-check-copy`, not `test-run` / `teardown`.
- **SEO audit:** `lib/seo`, `lib/stack-prompts/seo-rules.ts`, `/api/projects/[id]/seo`, workspace Quality → SEO & AI search.
- **Code quality audit:** `lib/audit/actions.ts` (and siblings except `log.ts`), `/api/projects/[id]/audit`, workspace Quality → Code & performance. Reuse the SEO fix pipeline; do not fork a second generation path.
- **Audit log:** `lib/audit/log.ts`, Prisma `AuditLog`, `/admin/audit`, `GET /api/admin/audit`. Distinct from CodeAudit. Merge `writeAudit` calls only; never log secrets. Retention prune is in thin-checkpoints (12 months).
- **Connectors / GitHub:** `app/(app)/connectors`, `lib/github`, `/api/github`.
- **Generation engine:** `lib/generation`, `generate-ai-code-stream`, `apply-ai-code-stream`. No route fetches a sibling route on its own origin — shared work lives in `lib/generation/analyze-edit-intent.ts` and `lib/sandbox/{read-files,install-packages,restart-dev,detect-packages}.ts`, and the routes are thin wrappers. Do not reintroduce `internalCallHeaders` or a self-origin `fetch`. Log every failure; inside a Job add `recordJobStepFailure`. Apply close copy is `applyOutcome` / `applyPageCopy` — do not compose a success line from `filesCreated.length`.
- **Instance self-identity:** `lib/runtime/self.ts`. The only reader of `COOLIFY_APP_UUID` — Sentry restart, `/api/admin/health/rollback`, and `scripts/rollback.ts` import `getSelfIdentity` and `SELF_UUID_NOT_CONFIGURED` instead of reading the env var.
- **URL import:** `lib/import`, Prisma `ImportSource`, `/api/projects/[id]/import`. Merge TopBar with a source-URL link only; do not rewrite SEO/Assets tabs. Hard-fail codes: `importJobErrorCode` in `lib/import/errors.ts` plus one `import_failed` line in `lib/jobs/copy.ts` / `types.ts` — add only that entry, never rewrite those files.
- **URL security:** `lib/security` (`url-guard`, `safeFetch`, untrusted HTML). User-supplied URLs only — do not wrap Coolify/Cloudflare/GitHub/Resend/E2B.
- **Workspace Skills:** `lib/skills`, `/settings/skills`, Prisma `Skill`. Conditional inject after the cacheable prefix. Do not fold into Brain memory.
- **Brain memory:** `lib/memory`, Prisma `MemoryEntry`, workspace Brain tab. Always-on; inside the cacheable prefix. Do not put skill content in the memory block.
- **Quality measurement:** `lib/signals`, `lib/prompts/version.ts`, `/admin/quality`. Merge hooks only into audits/checkpoints/persist. Do not auto-change prompts.
- **Error tracking:** `lib/logger`, `lib/sentry`, `lib/observability/`, `lib/request-id`, `lib/request-context`, `lib/api/error-response`, `GET /api/health`, `/admin/health`. Request IDs live in `proxy.ts`. Merge hooks only into generation/sandbox/publish/integrations/credits. Do not rewrite those engines. Heartbeat/quota/uptime/certs crons write `ObservabilityCheck` / `CronRun`; merge `writeAudit` is still audit-log only.
- **Coolify deploy settings:** `lib/coolify`, `/admin/servers`. Server rows come from `/admin/integrations`. Do not write tokens into source.
- **Integrations:** `lib/integrations/`, Prisma `Integration`, `/admin/integrations`. GitHub App Manifest + Cloudflare token + Coolify discover + Sentry DSN/OAuth. Publish reads the store — no `GITHUB_APP_*` / `CLOUDFLARE_*` / `ROOT_DOMAIN` env. Sentry is not required for publish.
- **Publish:** `lib/publish/`, `lib/github/deploy-client.ts`, `lib/cloudflare/dns.ts`, `/deployments`, workspace Publish sheet. GitHub App only — do not fall back to personal OAuth. Guard all three integrations CONNECTED first.
- **Custom domains:** `lib/domains`, Prisma `CustomDomain`, `/api/projects/[id]/domains`, `/api/cron/check-domains`, workspace Domains tab + `/project/[id]/domains`. Merge domain-remove into `lib/publish/cleanup.ts` only. Never delete a Path B Cloudflare zone.
- **Plans / credits:** `lib/plans`, Prisma `Plan` + `CreditLedger` + `Workspace` plan fields. Merge onto Workspace; do not drop `storageBytes`. ADMIN `/admin/plans` and `/admin/workspace`. Payment providers later call `assignWorkspacePlan` only. Consumption caps / spend ceiling / sandbox minutes merge into `limits.ts` and admin pages — do not rewrite those dashboards.
- **Backup / restore:** `lib/backup`, `scripts/backup-db.ts`, `scripts/restore-db.ts`, `scripts/verify-storage.ts`, Prisma `BackupRun`, `/admin/backups`, `POST /api/cron/backup-db`, `POST /api/cron/verify-storage`. Separate BACKUP_* bucket from ELK_*. Do not rewrite storage/publish APIs.
- **Project lock / presence:** `lib/projects/lock.ts`, `lib/projects/presence.ts`, Prisma `Project` lock fields + `ProjectPresence`, `/api/projects/[id]/presence`. Merge acquire/release around generate/import/publish/audit/restore only. Do not build realtime collab. Presence prune in thin-checkpoints.
- **Templates:** `lib/templates/`, Prisma `Template`, `/templates`, `/api/templates`, `/admin/templates`, `prisma/seed-templates.ts`. Merge chips + Browse templates into PromptHero; one overflow item into WorkspaceTopBar; optional `templateId` on create-project / pending-prompt. Do not rewrite PromptHero, Sidebar, or ProjectWorkspace.
- **Jobs / publish compensation:** `lib/jobs/` (including `compensate.ts`, `orphans.ts`, `copy.ts`, `recovery-retry.ts`). `copy.ts` imports `url-guard-messages` / `import/error-messages`, not `url-guard` (that module is `node:dns`). Prisma `Job` (`@@map("GenerationJob")`), `lib/runtime/instance.ts`, `lib/runtime/shutdown.ts`, `/api/cron/reap-jobs`, `/api/cron/cleanup-orphans`, `/admin/jobs`, workspace RecoveryPanel. Chat recovery is PLAN/BUILD/FOLLOWUP/IMPORT (`showsChatRecovery`); IMPORT Try again is `recoveryRetryIntent` → `streamProjectImport`. Merge job lifecycle into generate/apply/import/plan/audit/publish — do not rewrite those engines. Phase is a side effect of job transitions. Publish orchestration lives in `lib/publish/` and writes job steps; do not rewrite GitHub/Coolify/DNS clients. Provider failover/queue (`lib/ai/`: keyless skipped, `shouldFailover` kinds, 30s attempt timeout — not "never fail over on 4xx") and per-job caps (`lib/consumption/`) merge tokens/provider/queuePosition onto Job rows only.
- **ZIP export:** `lib/export/`, `GET /api/projects/[id]/export`. Checkpoint snapshots only (dead sandbox OK). Merge one overflow item + VersionHistory download. No credits. Rate limit 5/user/hour.
- **Onboarding:** `lib/onboarding/`, dashboard first-run cards + PromptTipsPanel + ProductTour. User `promptTipsDismissedAt` / `productTourCompletedAt`. Fill PromptHero via `navroop_pending_prompt`; do not generate on card click.
- **Project search:** `lib/search/projects.ts`, `GET /api/search?q=` (keep Firecrawl POST). Generated `searchVector` on Project (raw SQL, not in Prisma model). Cmd+K / sidebar input / `/projects` filter.
- **Legal:** `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/legal`. User `termsAcceptedAt` / `termsVersion`. Checkbox on AuthModal register + TermsGate for invitees. Data-request email from Settings → Profile. Draft copy only.
